AIRookie_Playground

This repository is derived from the following projects. Their authors' commit
history is not preserved here; the original repositories remain the authoritative
record of their work.

1. Open Duck Playground
   https://github.com/apirrone/Open_Duck_Playground
   Authors: Antoine Pirrone, Steve Nguyen and contributors
   The training environment under playground/ started from this repository.
   The upstream repository does not declare a license.

2. Open Duck reference motion generator
   https://github.com/apirrone/Open_Duck_reference_motion_generator
   Authors: Antoine Pirrone and contributors
   Vendored under tools/reference_motion_generator/ (upstream commit 3d7bc6f).
   The upstream repository does not declare a license.

3. Open Duck Mini
   https://github.com/apirrone/Open_Duck_Mini
   Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE-APACHE).
   The robot description (MJCF, URDF) and the meshes under
   tools/reference_motion_generator/open_duck_reference_motion_generator/robots/
   are derived from this project. The training meshes (cad3_*.stl) were replaced
   with the AI Rookie exterior.

4. MuJoCo Playground (inspiration for the environment layout)
   https://github.com/kscalelabs/mujoco_playground
